## rvest demo

```{r}
isa_page_in_r = rvest::read_html("https://bulletin.miamioh.edu/courses-instruction/isa/")

# if all titles look that same on the page it means that they have the same class/tag which allows you to extract them

isa_page_in_r |>
  rvest::html_elements(
    "#sc_sccoursedescs > div > p.courseblocktitle > strong"
  ) |>
  rvest::html_text2()
```

